      "content": "i feel like i don't even exist anymore. like everyone i knew just... collectively decided i wasn't real? i wake up and check my phone and it's just dead. no one is talking, no one is checking in, it's like they all just wiped me from existence. i'm just a ghost walking around a room where nobody sees me. it's so lonely it actually hurts.",
